// which prints them as the programs take them.
//
// To run a program, paste it at the end of the `blockfilter_tests` suite in
// `src/test/blockfilter_tests.cpp` at the specified revision, include
// `netmessagemaker.h` there, build it with `make -C src test/test_dash` and
// run `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=blockfilter_tests/<name>`. The output
// should match the section.
